    - Body: \{ project_id, gap_matrix_id, gap_axis_x, gap_axis_y, method_profile, synthesis_id \}\
    - Ad\uc0\u305 mlar:\
      a) project_pool \uc0\u8745  gap h\'fccresi \u8594  en g\'fc\'e7l\'fc 10 paper meta (title + abstract + cd_5 + q_weak)\
      b) 3.3'ten metod profili (en yo\uc0\u287 un 3 metod)\
      c) 3.4'ten sentez paragraf\uc0\u305  (\'f6zet ve gap arg\'fcman\u305 )\
      d) Gemini Pro \'e7a\uc0\u287 r\u305  + Pydantic structured output:\
         * 3 konu kart\uc0\u305 : \{ title, sub_questions: \{ cautious, balanced, bold \}, top_3_refs: [paper_id], method_suggestion, evidence_chain: \{ gap, method, synthesis \} \}\
      e) Output cache: project_id + gap_id key, 1 saat TTL\
    - Output: \{ proposals[3], generation_count, daily_quota_remaining \}\
\
(2) BACKEND \'97 yazma iskeleti endpoint:\
